{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_14_level_main_14-16_beg",
  "groupId": "main_14",
  "stageId": "main_14-16",
  "title": "在熾燃間咆哮",
  "storyCode": "14-18",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-16_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "026ceaa15a21d025cc88e218913322cfa4420415e837250471ad22199d851643",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "飛空艇的動力還在增強，骸骨的神經束正被撕扯著……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "源石已經讓那些神經束變得很脆弱了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果骸骨和飛空艇斷開連接，博士他們就算阻止了飛空艇也沒辦法回來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們已在協助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "放心，我允許給他們半個小時，便無食言的可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "女妖踏足在骸骨的脊椎之上，一步一筆，咒言於他的身後被書寫，最終落於神經束之上。\n抬筆劃過紅色的天空，咒文裹挾著神經束收緊，抬起……\n女妖以骨筆為支點，用咒言將千百神經束收於自己的掌控之中。\n鋼鐵在持續收緊的神經束中不斷發出爆鳴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "飛空艇在嘶吼，牽動著骸骨顆顆落下巨大的碎片。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "特雷西斯的巫靈部隊還在持續轟擊我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你這麼顯眼，會被當成頭號目標的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "無妨。這樣更好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "濃霧自可熄滅烈焰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "若是我不願意，烈日也無權穿透河谷的白霧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它們會護佑我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "濃厚的霧氣在Logos的身邊氤氳，聚集……逐漸讓他的身影無可捕捉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "炮擊轉眼便突入濃霧之中，無聲無息，留下的軌跡被迅速填補。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "W，我們能爭取的時間不多了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "W小姐，我接住你了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳……咳……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這老東西的家難道還會移動？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我沒有在那個位置找到任何東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不要將飛空艇完全視為一件死物，死魂靈的存在已經讓它有別於一般的“武器”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在它的軀殼內部，我們的認知會被它的力量所擾動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "艙室內目之所及皆是湧動著的黑色潮水，死魂靈寄居的囚籠從你們的視野中消失。\n網狀的影子卻持續不斷地試圖攀附上你們的身體。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（厭惡地甩開陰影）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "博士，Mon3tr會護住我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mon3tr，不要傷到博士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你拍了拍將你頂在肩上的Mon3tr。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "別擔心，凱爾希，我們的合作已經很默契了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（輕快的高鳴）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "……情緒，充斥在整個房間裡。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "陰影……鋪天蓋地。在死魂靈的法術影響下，我沒有辦法定位到核心現在準確的位置。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "死魂靈顯然在改變策略。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "他很清楚有阿米婭在，短時間內不可能對我們造成威脅。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "改變策略的恐怕不是死魂靈，而是……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "他在替人拖延時間。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "……特蕾西婭小姐。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不能再猶豫了，我們只有這一次機會。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "她抬起了手，十枚戒指的紋路開始流動。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "黑色的鎖鏈自紋路中浮現，纏繞……"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "鎖鏈自阿米婭的手中奔襲而出，撞入湧動的潮水之中。\n黑色的鎖鏈捆縛了黑色的陰影之海，將其收攏為黑色的球體。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "飛空艇在咆哮，陰影的浪潮不斷拍擊法術的封鎖。\n鎖鏈每一次震動，阿米婭都被迫與混亂無序的情感共鳴。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "阿米婭！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "——我，我能撐得住。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "但我不知道能困住他多長時間——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "阿米婭，開啟一道入口。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Mon3tr，準備進入——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我來。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "呵，我怕你沒了自己的小寵物——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "老女人，殿下她能看到我們，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "她的意志，一直都在。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "小兔子，開開門。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我怕殿下忘了我，總得提前預告一下。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "好，進去之後，我會幫你！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "鎖鏈轉動，陰影自缺口處不斷湧出。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "老東西，別擠了，沒看見我正要進門嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "嘖，這麼熱情地歡迎我，看來之前的禮物很得你心啊。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那別急，我這還多得是呢！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "她撕扯著缺口，嘴裡銜住手榴彈，踹了幾腳陰影後便一躍而入。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我們得在特蕾西婭真正插手前結束這次行動。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "……是的，博士。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "缺口已然開始閉合。\n然而在無人察覺的時候，一團微不可見的陰影正自縫隙處流下……\n緩緩地向著阿米婭前行。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "一旦飛空艇被成功阻止——",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我們將要面對的就是她了——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "死魂靈的聲音驟然在阿米婭的腦海中響起。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "在她還未來得及反應之時，已然流淌到她腳下的陰影如火焰般炸開……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "——！"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "阿米婭的耳邊響起了急促地呼喊自己的聲音。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士……凱爾希醫生……"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "死魂靈的怒吼震動著艙室內每一寸牆面。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "自陰影中脫缚而出的長矛化作一枚造型怪異的符號，將阿米婭貫穿……\n她被凌空釘於黑色的球體之前。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "鎖鏈摩擦，撕扯，鬆動……\n鮮血已墜向地面。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "——？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "什麼動靜？"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "她能感覺到，阿米婭依舊在某處陪伴著自己。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "小兔子……顧不上了，得趕快找到那個老東西。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "“情緒波動最明顯的地方”……在哪裡呢？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "這麼黑，幫你點個燈，老東——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "——？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "——！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我*薩卡茲粗口*炸藥呢？！不可能忘——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "流動的陰影淹沒了她。\n她突然感覺腳下不再有支點，如同瞬間溺入深淵。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "唔——"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "冰冷。為何沒有生命的氣息？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "這……不是飛空艇？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "她看到了……一副鏽跡斑斑的巨型鎧甲正在荒野上劈砍巨石。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "一個會動的鐵皮……還沒頭？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "怎麼一句都聽不懂——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "等等……石頭，在說話？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "她仔細檢查了自己隨身的物品，的確沒有任何早已準備好的爆炸物。\n死魂靈。意識。情緒。\n她的腦海中突然跳出了斷斷續續的詞語。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那個石頭中的……也是死魂靈？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "呵，小兔子，是你在說話？這就是你說的幫忙吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "無人應答。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "撐住，阿米婭。我很快就回去。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "她看向了拖著巨石走進天災的無頭鎧甲。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "沉默片刻，她追了上去，衝入天災之中——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "她看到了天災中的風暴席捲而來，死魂靈正在撕扯死魂靈。\n她無法從中感受到任何情緒。那裡只有被源石風暴攪亂的殘破意識。\n核心不會在這裡。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "戰場廢墟之中，寄宿在飲滿鮮血的刀劍裡的瘋狂死魂靈被無頭的鎧甲拘束，塞入古老的巨石之中。\nW很失望，核心也不在這裡。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "叢林裡，無頭的巨鎧捣碎了被巫術團體所膜拜的祭壇，背負起刻滿印記的符文石。\n懦弱迷離的死魂靈躲藏在其中。\n但核心不在這裡……"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "遠離人煙的荒漠。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "被劫掠一空的聚居地……"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "她追隨情緒不斷尋找，穿行。恐懼……欣喜……貪婪……厭惡……\n那位寄宿於鎧甲中的強大死魂靈將他的同胞們封存於一塊塊巨石之中，他拖拽著同胞的靈魂遊走在這片大地。\n但他卻又放過火山之下，躲藏在金屬軀殼中的死魂靈。\n她感受著死魂靈在這片大地上遊走時所散發出的那一絲微弱的情緒，卻一無所獲。\n她甚至產生了更多的困惑。這個收集同類的死魂靈……他到底想幹嘛？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "微弱的火焰在熔爐中奄奄一息。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "這裡是……卡茲戴爾的魂靈熔爐？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不可能。我記得這裡的火光，晚上都能照亮城市上方的天空。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "這裡的火勢……怎麼會這麼弱？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "等等——這不是我熟悉的那個魂靈熔爐……"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "——！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "死魂靈在怒號。\n他將鏽跡斑斑的無頭鎧甲抛入熔爐之中，接著，便是那些封存了同胞的巨石。\n那位最先焚燒自己的死魂靈將自己的同胞束縛，點燃……"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "魂靈熔爐的火焰在噴發！\n他興奮、痛苦，直至麻木。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "哈，我現在有點喜歡你了，老東西。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "死魂靈衝入了熊熊烈焰之中，他最後點燃的，也是自己。\nW站在熔爐的邊緣，火焰撩撥著她的髮梢。\n她嘆了口氣，掐滅火星。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "老東西，我要找的東西在哪裡你還沒告訴我！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "要是在這裡能用炸彈多好……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "“砰砰砰”！直接就能在火裡炸出一條通路——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "嘁……"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "她一躍而下，墜入熔爐之中。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "烈焰焚燒著她，痛苦，她在怒罵。\n死魂靈的哀嚎。\n悲傷。無盡的悲傷。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "她不斷地下墜，下墜，直到接近最初的柴薪……\n最初點燃自己的死魂靈。\n她在熔爐的烈焰中看到了那個不斷波動的核心。\n淚水被熱浪拭去……呵。\n她笑了，隨即捏住了足以焚盡一切的魂靈核心——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我抓到你了，老東西……"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "給！我！下！來！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "當W的雙手觸碰到飛空艇上這處焚燒靈魂的熔爐的瞬間，爆裂的火焰散開，包裹住了她。\n熱浪源源不斷地向她湧去，死魂靈意欲焚盡背叛族群的薩卡茲。\n引擎的高溫已經灼痛了她的雙手——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你他媽，吵死了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "她不顧一切地抓緊了飛空艇真正的引擎。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "啊——"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "死魂靈的陰影以從未有過的速度迅速回縮，收攏……\n他要回到自己的熔爐，焚燒自我、承受罪孽的熔爐——\n“W小姐……！”"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "黑色的法術貫穿了火焰，落在W的身邊。\n湧向W的陰影有了一剎那的停滯，而後便無法再撞破黑色的屏障。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "死魂靈盤旋於W的身後，他即是陰影……\n而他此刻已完全張開了自己，如黑色的雙翼展開，籠罩一切——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "下來吧你！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "飛空艇的引擎應聲斷裂。\n於倫蒂尼姆上空呼嘯而過，威脅著所有維多利亞人的空中堡壘終於停下了自己跳動的心臟"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "呼……呼……"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "“W！W！醒醒！”"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "老女人——？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（興奮的低鳴）"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "——？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "怎麼是你抱著我！放開，不然我連你的爪子一起炸掉！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（不屑地戳戳）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "W，我只能幫你簡單地處理傷口，我們現在得解決另一個麻煩了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "沒關係，我的命還很硬。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "小兔子呢，我們的配合簡直——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "阿米婭，你……怎麼受了這麼重的傷？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "你攙扶著阿米婭，女孩瘦小的身軀微微發抖。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "死魂靈突然襲擊了阿米婭。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "多虧你擊敗了死魂靈。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "咳……不用擔心我……這點傷不要緊的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我們現在得準備返回骸骨。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "失去了動力，飛空艇已經完全失控。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Logos，我們這邊結束了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "很高興你們平安。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "請稍候，我這就去接應你們。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "希望還來得及……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "等等，怎麼沒看到他？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我拆下來的那個老東西呢——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "她看到了地上損壞的引擎核心，沒有燃燒，沒有哀嚎。\n拘束靈魂的核心終於露出了真正的面目。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "這像炮一樣的東西就是他的核心？用起來好像挺順手。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "嘖，剛才我的武器也被那個老東西弄壞了，就算他賠我的吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "他……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "小兔子，你應該也看到了？這個老東西的一生也算……那個字該怎麼說來著？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "波瀾壯闊？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "W小姐……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我可沒有半點為這個老東西悲傷的意思。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "……我只是在想殿下的事。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "這艘船，那些巴別塔的幽靈，還有死魂靈……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我們到現在，都還沒見到特蕾西婭小姐。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "她現在，在哪裡？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
